    "description": "Text → MIDI (midi-llm / midi-gen) → PreviewMidi into GenerateAudio (ace-step-1.5-sft) for text-to-music. Style + optional lyrics Prompts; empty lyrics = instrumental. SaveMidi / SaveGenerateLog on the MIDI branch; Normalize → Preview/SaveAudio on the music branch. Install midi-llm (Mac MPS) and ace-step-1.5-sft (prefer CUDA) before real Render.",
